{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27286","headline":"题杜宾客新丰里幽居 · 蒋防","name":"题杜宾客新丰里幽居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"退迹依三迳，辞荣继二疏。\n圣情容解印，帝里许悬车。\n已去龙楼籍，犹分御廪储。\n风泉输耳目，松竹助玄虚。\n调护心常在，山林意有余。\n应嗤紫芝客，远就白云居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}